{"meta":{"ph":"ʃɔː(r); NAmE ʃɔːr","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"the land along the edge of the sea or ocean, a lake or another large area of water （海洋、湖泊等大水域的）岸，滨","ex":[]},{"def":"a country, especially one with a coast 国家（尤指濒海国家）","ex":[{"s":"The bay was   45   in sunshine, and there was a group of kayakers around 150m off the shore.","src":"2018全国II卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"海湾___45___在阳光中，离岸约150米处有一群皮划艇运动员。"},{"s":"We were walking on fine, even sand, not wrinkled, as on a flat shore, which keeps the impression of the waves.","src":"外研社B3 U5","cat":"waiyan","t":"在平坦的海岸上,我们行走着, 甚至是沙子,而不是皱纹, 这让海浪留下了深刻的印象。"},{"s":"Thoreau, the noted American essayist, poet and philosopher, lived for about two years in a cabin on its shores.","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"Thoreau是美国著名散文家,诗人和哲学家,在其海岸的一个小屋里生活了大约两年."},{"s":"The hills which form its shores are so steep, and the woods on them were then so high that, as you looked down from the west end, it had the appearance of an amphitheatre for some land of sylvan spectacle.","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"形成其海岸的山丘非常陡峭, 上面的树林非常高, 当你从西端俯瞰时, 它出现了一个两栖动物园, 对于一些Sylvan的景点。"},{"s":"I will arise and go now, for always night and day I hear lake water lapping with low sounds by the shore; While I stand on the roadway, or on the pavements grey, I hear it in the deep heart’s core.","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"我将起身离去，因为日夜我总听到湖水轻拍岸边的低声；当我站在路旁或灰色人行道上，我在内心深处听到它。"}]},{"def":"to support part of a building or other large structure by placing large pieces of wood or metal against or under it so that it does not fall down 用撑柱支撑","ex":[{"s":"But since I left those shores the woodchoppers have still further laid them waste, and now for many a year there will be no more rambling through the aisles of the wood, with occasional vistas through which you see the water...","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"但自从我离开这些海岸后 木雕们仍然进一步将它们埋设在废墟上 一年多的时间里 木头的过道上不会再有杂乱无章的痕迹"}]},{"def":"to help to support sth that is weak or going to fail 支撑；稳住","ex":[]}]}